Mmmm. But the original question here was - is it worth checking to see if
all fountains are magic? One benefit there is increased prowess with
spells across the board. Now it was asserted that barbarians get no
benefit there; I say they do, but the chance of using magic mapping is
only one of those benefits. Identify and an earlier burned-out spell are
two other ones, with the latter practically guaranteed.
